<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Alfa Wolf Pack, 1987</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;The 'Third World War' is here. &lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;There are offensive operations around all the globe. Norway has signed a pact with the USSR, declaring neutrality. The world is teetering&lt;EM&gt; &lt;/EM&gt;on the brink of a nuclear war. At this moment both sides are only using tactical nuclear weapons at sea due to the threat of Mutally Assured Destruction. &lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;NATO forces are trying to enter our SSBN bastions in order to destroy our SSBN fleet. Ultimately this will give NATO nuclear superiority and the freedom to launch ICBMs over our cities and force our unconditional surrender. &lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Victory, or death. &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT color=gray size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;Author: Ce_Zeta.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT color=gray size=2&gt;Version: 0.71&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
